{
  "dom_id": "step-e14649",
  "name": "Example: Finding the Domain and Range of a Relation",
  "problem": "Consider the following relation on $\\mathbb R^2.$\n\n$$\nR = \\big\\{ (x,y) \\in \\mathbb R^2 \\: : \\: y = \\sin{x} \\big\\}\n$$\n\nWhat are the domain and range of this relation?",
  "worked_solution": "Given a relation $R \\subseteq A \\times B,$ \n\n- the *domain* of $R$ is the set containing all elements from $A$ that appear as the first component of the ordered pairs in $R,$ and\n\n- the *range* of $R$ is the set containing all elements from $B$ that appear as the second component of the ordered pairs in $R.$\n\nWith that in mind, we examine the given relation.\n\n- The set of first components contains all real numbers $\\mathbb{R}.$\nHence, the domain is $\\mathbb{R}.$\n\n- Notice that $-1 \\leq \\sin{x} \\leq  1$ for all $x\\in\\mathbb R,$ and it is continuous on $\\mathbb R.$ So, the set of second components contains all real numbers greater than or equal to $-1$ and less than or equal to $1$:\n\n$$\n\\big\\{y\\in \\mathbb R \\::\\: -1 \\leq y \\leq 1\\big\\}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the range is $\\{ y\\in \\mathbb R\\:: \\: -1 \\leq y \\leq 1 \\}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e14649\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding the Domain and Range of a Relation</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e14649\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                    